Snor Windows preview — MOCK BINARY PLACEHOLDER (v0.1.0).

This file exists so the landing site's download button works end to end
before the signed release is ready. It is NOT the real Snor executable.

To go live:
1. cargo build --release (in the Snor repo)
2. Sign the exe
3. Attach it to a GitHub Release at https://github.com/MR-STARK87/Snor/releases
4. Replace this file with the signed binary (keep the same filename),
   or point the site's download links at the release asset URL.
5. Update size + SHA-256 in version.json and the download card in index.html.

Requirements for the real build: Windows 10/11, 64-bit. ~11 MB, no installer.
